message: "If you use this dataset, cite the dataset version and retain the underlying source references."
type: dataset
title: "Czechoslovak Commercial Banking, 1919–1937: Joint-stock banks in the Czech lands"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
url: "https://adamdittrich.github.io/czechoslovak-commercial-banking.html"
repository-code: "https://github.com/adamdittrich/adamdittrich.github.io/tree/main/assets/files/datasets/commercial-banking"
authors:
  - family-names: Dittrich
    given-names: Adam
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7803-1339"
abstract: >-
  Annual joint-stock-bank accounts for the Czech lands, 1919–1937; a fixed
  fourteen-bank panel for 1933–1937; a dated national institutional crosswalk;
  and separate central-bank and price context. The release includes frozen
  inputs, definitions, source locators and reproducible transformations.
keywords:
  - Czechoslovakia
  - commercial banking
  - economic history
  - bank capital
  - League of Nations
